  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS: <br>•\t5 Bedrooms<br>•\t4.5 Full Bathrooms<br>•\tSleeps 14<br>•\tPrivate Courtyard<br>•\tPrivate Oasis with Heated Pool (Pool can be heated for an additional $30 per day between Oct 1 - May 1)<br>•\t6 Seater Golf Cart Included<br>•\t6 Adult Bikes Included<br>•\tCarriage House<br>•\tParking for 4 Vehicles<br> <br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (Sleeps 14)<br><br>SECOND FLOOR: (Sleeps 8)<br>•\tKing Guest Suite (sleeps 2) and ensuite bathroom with single vanity and shower/tub combo + Private Balcony<br>•\tKing Guest Suite (sleeps 2) and ensuite bathroom with double vanity and walk-in tile/glass shower<br>•\tBunk Room (sleeps 4) with two sets of twin over twin bunks<br><br>THIRD FLOOR (Sleeps 2)<br>•\tKing Primary Suite (sleeps 2) with fireplace and ensuite bathroom with double vanity, garden tub * walk-in tile/glass shower + Balcony<br><br>CARRIAGE HOUSE (Sleeps 4)<br>•\tQueen Guest Suite (sleeps 2) and ensuite bathroom with single vanity and walk-in tile/glass shower<br>•\tQueen Sleeper Sofa (sleeps 2)<br><br>DESCRIPTION: <br>Experience unparalleled comfort and luxury with Echelon Luxury Properties at \"North Winston Villa,\" a stunning 5-bedroom, 4.5-bath home with a carriage house, perfectly situated on the scenic park side of 30A. This beautifully designed retreat offers the ultimate getaway for families looking to relax, unwind, and create unforgettable memories. The home is beautifully decorated with lush furnishings, modern accents, and an inviting ambiance that perfectly blends sophistication and comfort.<br><br>The private courtyard is a true oasis, featuring a heated pool, lounge chairs, a grill, a dining table, a covered deck, and access to the charming carriage house. Inside the main home, you’ll find an open concept living and dining area, a fully stocked gourmet kitchen, and a cozy gas fireplace. The property boasts four bedrooms, 3.5 baths, two private balconies, and an exquisite master suite occupying the entire third floor.<br>Upon entering the first floor, you'll notice the gourmet kitchen with top-tier appliances, a spacious living area with comfortable seating, and a gas fireplace, as well as a convenient half-bath. The interior design is enhanced by thoughtful touches, including plush seating, elegant fixtures, and a soothing color palette that reflects the coastal surroundings. On the second floor, the home features a laundry room, a bunk room with four twin-sized beds and a sliding barn door, and two guest suites, each with a king-sized bed, flat-screen TV, and private en-suite bathroom with a walk-in shower. The entire third floor is dedicated to the luxurious master suite, which boasts vaulted ceilings, a king-sized bed, a gas fireplace, a private balcony, and an opulent en-suite bathroom with an oversized tub and shower.<br><br>The private carriage house offers additional space for up to four guests. It includes a bedroom with a queen-sized bed, a full bathroom, a fully equipped kitchen, a private balcony, and a pull-out queen sleeper sofa for extra flexibility.<br>Beach access is just 0.3 miles away, and the vibrant town center of Rosemary Beach is within walking or biking distance, offering fantastic dining, shopping, and entertainment options. A private walking trail directly behind the villa provides access to Big Bad Breakfast, one of 30A's top-rated brunch spots. If you’re visiting on a Sunday, don’t miss the nearby 30A Farmers Market, open from 9 AM to 1 PM.<br><br>Discover your family’s annual vacation destination at North Winston Villa, where luxury, style, and relaxation come together to create unforgettable experiences year after year.<br><br>LAYOUT<br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>•\tFamily Room with Gas Fireplace<br>•\tKitchen with Upscale Appliances and Pantry<br>•\tKitchen Island with Bench Seating and side bar table (seats 4)<br>•\tGuest Half Bath<br>•\tAccess to Outdoor Oasis with Private Heated Pool<br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>•\tKing Guest Suite with Ensuite Bath<br>•\tKing Guest Suite with Ensuite Bath<br>•\tBunk Room (two twin over twin bunks)<br>•\tLaundry Facilities<br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>•\tPrimary King Suite with Ensuite Bath<br>CARRIAGE HOUSE:<br>•\tOpen Living Area with Kitchenette & Queen Sleeper Sofa<br>•\tQueen Guest Suite with Ensuite Bath<br>•\tPrivate Balcony<br>•\tAccess to Garage with Laundry Facilities & Additional Refrigerator<br>OUTDOOR AREA:<br>•\tPrivate Heated Pool<br>•\tOutdoor Shower<br>•\tOutdoor Dining & Sun Loungers<br>•\tGrilling Station (Gas)<br>•\tParking for 4 Cars<br>•\tFenced Backyard",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "North Winston Villa|Easy Beach Access|Private Pool & Golf Cart"
        }
