        "id": "6887ad409ddf4b33fca0b668",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Great place. Very clean. Well stocked. Comfortable beds. In a convenient area that’s within walking distance of a lot of different places. The bikes were clutch and we used them a lot. We didn’t use the golf cart much because the beach access point is on a one way road and to get there from the VRBO you have to either go the wrong way down it or go onto a highway which is illegal to take the golf cart on. There is also no where really to park the golf cart if you do take it out. Would absolutely recommend this place to others and come back in the future. Great trip.",
